{
 "_why": "#108 (his 11-07 asks: 'for banished and for pits and for spike freind ... either .gif or a HD extracted art thats related and properly matched for those and others like it'; 'https://classic.battle.net/diablo2exp/monsters/act1-fallen.shtml these are wonderful try this website'; bosses too; 'for uber lilith use this [Arreat's Andariel]'; 'make sure they are diffrent for uber duriel'). Source: The Arreat Summit, Blizzard's own Diablo II site - one animated gif per monster FAMILY, and the family's variant names in its own text. A random-pack name maps to the family page whose variant list names it; a name two families list is settled by its area's act (Blood Lord in the Durance = Vampire; Night Lord in the Halls of Anguish = the Act 5 Blood Lord). Every file was looked at on a labelled contact sheet and read COLD by the Grok CLI on a blind sheet (grokCold, its own words) before it was wired. Bosses: a boss and its uber never share a picture - the regular keeps its earlier sprite (monster_art_fandom.json), the uber wears the Arreat Summit's (Uber Lilith = Arreat's Andariel). Each gif's uniform black margin is trimmed across ALL its frames (the union of where any frame draws, +4px), so the monster fills its tile like the earlier sprites; sourceSha1 is the Arreat Summit's own file, sha1 the trimmed one.",
